{
  "_README": [
    "TEMPLATE 1 of 4 — SERVICES OVERVIEW  (/services)",
    "",
    "Complete, self-contained @graph for the page. Everything the page needs is here: the",
    "business entity, the website, the page itself, its hero image, breadcrumbs, and the",
    "service list.",
    "",
    "WHAT THIS FIXES vs your live markup",
    "  1. numberOfItems said 6 — you have 7 live service pages. asset-tracking-reporting was",
    "     missing from the list entirely.",
    "  2. No @id, description, isPartOf or breadcrumb on the CollectionPage (your industries",
    "     overview has all four — the two pages were inconsistent).",
    "  3. No business entity on the page, so it carried zero local signals despite targeting",
    "     'electronics recycling services Cincinnati'.",
    "  4. No image anywhere in the markup. The page has a purpose-built hero at",
    "     /assets/industries-services-hero/services-overview-hero.png that nothing declared.",
    "  5. ListItem entries had no name, description or image — just a bare nested item.",
    "",
    "RICH RESULT ELIGIBILITY: Breadcrumbs. CollectionPage and ItemList are not standalone",
    "rich results here (ItemList carousels only apply to Recipe, Course, Restaurant and Movie),",
    "but they are strong entity-comprehension signals and feed AI surfaces.",
    "",
    "Replace the _business-node block with the shared include. It is shown inline here so you",
    "can see the whole graph in one place.",
    "Strip all _README and _comment keys before shipping."
  ],

  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [

    {
      "_comment": "SHARED BUSINESS NODE — identical on every page. See _business-node.jsonld for the full version with all comments. Abbreviated here only to keep this file readable; ship the COMPLETE node.",
      "@type": "RecyclingCenter",
      "@id": "https://core-asset-sol.com/#organization",
      "name": "Core Asset Solutions",
      "url": "https://core-asset-sol.com/",
      "email": "info@core-asset-sol.com",
      "telephone": "+1-513-433-7818",
      "priceRange": "$$",
      "logo": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
